flowchart TD
  Start([Start]) --> Signup[Open signup]
  Signup --> Validate{Client form valid?}
  Validate -- No --> FormError[Show validation feedback]
  FormError --> Signup
  Validate -- Yes --> Auth[Submit to Auth/backend]
  Auth --> AuthOK{Auth and required initialization succeeded?}
  AuthOK -- No --> Recovery[Show actionable error; allow safe retry]
  Recovery --> Signup
  AuthOK -- Yes --> Next[Continue to actual next signup step]
  Next --> PaymentNote[Payment step implementation must be verified]
  PaymentNote --> Provider{Verified provider event?}
  Provider -- No --> Pending[Do not mark paid; show pending/failure state]
  Provider -- Yes --> Record[Idempotently update trusted payment/subscription records]
  Record --> Done([Show confirmed membership state])
